# Localhost visual notebook and handwriting editors

## Scope and existing evidence

Provide notebook and handwriting profile tabs in the existing localhost UI,
open/save actions, and a bounded preview with sliders and numeric controls for
every admitted editable scalar.

The historical accepted theoretical design is preserved in completed P1–P9
records. This record is **open executable integration work**. It must not be
closed merely because a prior design was accepted or a different
implementation was proposed.

## Acceptance decision

Open. Provide the actual bounded Rust/backend or browser integration and an
accepted/refused example before marking the executable capability complete.
Theoretical design acceptance alone cannot establish that this feature runs.
